[gd_scene load_steps=5 format=3 uid="uid://unit_animation_player_autoplay"]

; AnimationPlayer in Godot 4's real serialization: clips live in an AnimationLibrary
; `_data` map keyed by StringName (`&"name"`), the player references the default
; library via the slash form `libraries/ = SubResource(...)`, and `autoplay` is itself
; a StringName (`&"spin"`). Exercises the linter's library-resolved existence check
; against the StringName form — the autoplay clip resolves, so this lints clean.

